        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "SEG7CC",
          "text": ".subckt SEG7CC a b c d e f g dp com1 com2\n* one red LED per segment, from its pin to the common cathode\nDa a com1 DSEG\nDb b com1 DSEG\nDc c com1 DSEG\nDd d com1 DSEG\nDe e com1 DSEG\nDf f com1 DSEG\nDg g com1 DSEG\nDdp dp com1 DSEG\n* the two COM pins are joined inside\nRcom com1 com2 0.01\n.model DSEG D(IS=7.041e-13 N=3.037 RS=6.477 BV=5 IBV=1e-05 EG=2.312 XTI=2)\n.ends SEG7CC",
          "pins": [
